        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Patrick Hillery, Charles Haughey\n- Organizations: 25th Dáil\n- Roles: President of Ireland, Taoiseach of Ireland\n- Events: Dissolution of the 25th Dáil\n\nFacts:\n- Charles Haughey was born on 16 September 1925 and died on 13 June 2006.\n- Charles Haughey served as Taoiseach of Ireland from December 1979 to June 1981, from March 1982 to December 1982, and from March 1987 to February 1992.\n- On 25 May 1989, President Patrick Hillery dissolved the 25th Dáil at the request of Taoiseach Charles Haughey.",
